//! # Abstract
//! This module connects the absolute state of a system (`MetricsSnapshot`) with
//! the relative rate of change (`MetricsDiff`) to categorize the current behavior
//! of the VM.
//!
//! # The Hero's Journey
//!
//! ```rust
